<h2>7. DAL — Entity, Repository, UnitOfWork</h2>

<h3>7.1 Danh sách Entity (class name)</h3>
<table>
  <tr><th>Entity</th><th>PK</th><th>Ghi chú field quan trọng</th></tr>
  <tr><td>Role</td><td>RoleID</td><td>RoleName</td></tr>
  <tr><td>User</td><td>UserID</td><td>Username, Password (BCrypt), RoleID, Status</td></tr>
  <tr><td>House</td><td>HouseID</td><td>OwnerID → User (Landlord)</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Room</td><td>RoomID</td><td>HouseID, Price, Area, Status (Available/Occupied/Maintenance)</td></tr>
  <tr><td>RoomImage</td><td>ImageID</td><td>ImagePath, DisplayOrder</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Amenity / RoomAmenity</td><td>—</td><td>Tiện nghi phòng</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Post / PostImage</td><td>PostID</td><td>Status: Pending/Approved/Rejected</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Favorite</td><td>FavoriteID</td><td>UserID + RoomID</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Appointment</td><td>AppointmentID</td><td>RoomID, TenantID, AppointmentDate, Status</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Contract</td><td>ContractID</td><td>xem bảng chi tiết bên dưới</td></tr>
  <tr><td>MeterReading</td><td>ReadingID</td><td>ReadingMonth, Old/New Electric/Water</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Invoice</td><td>InvoiceID</td><td>Rent, ElectricCost, WaterCost, OtherFee, Total, Status</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Payment</td><td>PaymentID</td><td>InvoiceID, Amount, Method, Status</td></tr>
  <tr><td>MaintenanceRequest</td><td>RequestID</td><td>Title, Description, Image, Status, AssignedManager</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Assignment</td><td>AssignmentID</td><td>HouseID, ManagerID, Status Active</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Review</td><td>ReviewID</td><td>Rating, Comment, LandlordReply</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Notification</td><td>NotificationID</td><td>UserID, Title, Content, IsRead</td></tr>
  <tr><td>ActivityLog</td><td>LogID</td><td>Action, Details</td></tr>
  <tr><td>ChatConversation</td><td>ConversationID</td><td>LandlordID, TenantID (unique pair)</td></tr>
  <tr><td>ChatMessage</td><td>MessageID</td><td>SenderID, Content, ImagePath, IsRead</td></tr>
</table>

<h3>7.2 Contract — fields quan trọng</h3>
<table>
  <tr><th>Property</th><th>Kiểu</th><th>Ý nghĩa</th></tr>
  <tr><td>ContractCode</td><td>string</td><td>Mã HĐ (VD HD00001)</td></tr>
  <tr><td>RoomID / TenantID</td><td>int</td><td>FK phòng / khách thuê</td></tr>
  <tr><td>StartDate / EndDate</td><td>DateTime</td><td>Thời hạn hợp đồng</td></tr>
  <tr><td>MoveInDate / MoveOutDate</td><td>DateTime / DateTime?</td><td>Ngày nhận / trả phòng — dùng prorate</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Deposit</td><td>decimal</td><td>Tiền cọc</td></tr>
  <tr><td>MonthlyRent</td><td>decimal</td><td>Tiền nhà đủ tháng</td></tr>
  <tr><td>ElectricPrice / WaterPrice</td><td>decimal</td><td>Đơn giá điện / nước</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Status</td><td>string</td><td>Active / …</td></tr>
  <tr><td>CreatedBy</td><td>int</td><td>User tạo HĐ (thường Landlord)</td></tr>
</table>

<h3>7.3 UnitOfWork pattern</h3>
<pre>
IUnitOfWork
  ├── Users, Houses, Rooms, Contracts, Invoices, ...
  ├── ChatConversations, ChatMessages
  ├── SaveChangesAsync()
  └── BeginTransactionAsync / Commit / Rollback

BLL: constructor(IUnitOfWork unitOfWork, IMapper mapper)
UI:  constructor(IXxxService service)  // không inject UnitOfWork
</pre>
<p><code>GenericRepository&lt;T&gt;</code>: <code>FindAsync(predicate, includeProperties)</code> — include dạng chuỗi <code>"Contract.Room,Manager"</code>.</p>

