<h3>8.1 Exception nghiệp vụ</h3>
<ul>
  <li><code>BadRequestException</code> — validation / rule (message tiếng Việt) → UI hiện Warning</li>
  <li><code>NotFoundException</code> — không tìm thấy entity</li>
  <li><code>UnauthorizedException</code> — đăng nhập thất bại / không đủ quyền</li>
</ul>

<!-- ============================================================ -->
<h2>9. DTO &amp; AutoMapper</h2>
<p>Quy ước tên DTO:</p>
<ul>
  <li><code>*Dto</code> — đọc/list (VD <code>InvoiceDto</code>)</li>
  <li><code>*DetailDto</code> — chi tiết đầy đủ (<code>InvoiceDetailDto</code>, <code>RoomDetailDto</code>)</li>
  <li><code>Create*Dto</code> / <code>Update*Dto</code> — input ghi</li>
  <li><code>LoginRequestDto</code> / <code>LoginResponseDto</code> — auth</li>
</ul>
<p>Mapping tập trung tại <code>RPMS.BLL/Mappings/MappingProfile.cs</code>. Ví dụ:</p>
<ul>
  <li><code>Post → PostDto</code>: <code>MainImage</code> lấy PostImages (IsMain) hoặc fallback RoomImages</li>
  <li><code>MaintenanceRequest → MaintenanceRequestDto</code>: map <code>Image → ImagePath</code>, TenantName, HouseName, …</li>
  <li><code>Invoice → InvoiceDetailDto</code>: kèm MeterReading, Tenant, Room, Contract</li>
</ul>

<!-- ============================================================ -->
<h2>10. WinForms — Form / Control / Helper</h2>

<h3>10.1 UI constants</h3>
<table>
  <tr><th>Class</th><th>Ví dụ</th></tr>
  <tr><td>AppColors</td><td>Primary #2563EB, Background #F8FAFC, Card White, Border #E5E7EB, Success/Warning/Danger, TextMain/TextMuted</td></tr>
  <tr><td>AppTypography</td><td>Segoe UI — Heading, Subtitle, Body</td></tr>
</table>

<h3>10.2 Helper layout</h3>
<ul>
  <li><code>UIHelper.ApplyFormStyle</code> / <code>ApplyResizableDialog</code> — form Sizable, MinimumSize</li>
  <li><code>UIHelper.WireListPage(form, header, content)</code> — header Dock Top, DGV Dock Fill</li>
  <li><code>UIHelper.SoftAnchorDialogControls</code> — gắn Anchor cho TextBox/PictureBox trên modal Designer</li>
  <li><code>ImagePathHelper</code> — resolve <code>/uploads/...</code>, placeholder, sample images</li>
  <li><code>AppDialog</code> — ShowInfo / ShowError / ShowWarning / Confirm / Prompt</li>
</ul>

<h3>10.3 OpenChildForm</h3>
<pre>
childForm.TopLevel = false;
childForm.FormBorderStyle = None;
childForm.Dock = Fill;
childForm.AutoScroll = false;   // form con tự layout Dock/Anchor
pnlContent.Controls.Add(childForm);
</pre>

